    <unit id="proj.fleetpulse.description">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">src/app/components/projects/projects.ts:30</note>
      </notes>
      <segment>
        <source>Predictive maintenance platform for commercial vehicle fleets. A C# simulator streams ECU telemetry over gRPC to Spring Boot microservices, which store it per service in PostgreSQL, fan it out through Kafka and score vehicle risk, backed by a gradient-boosted model trained in Python and exported to ONNX. Includes a JWT-secured gateway, alerting, work orders and a Vaadin ops dashboard.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="proj.lanelet.description">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">src/app/components/projects/projects.ts:38</note>
      </notes>
      <segment>
        <source>Reimplementing core Lanelet2 HD-map algorithms for autonomous driving from scratch in C++17 (Frenet conversion, map matching, routing and map validation) and grading each implementation against the library&apos;s own reference output.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="proj.gait.title">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">src/app/components/projects/projects.ts:46</note>
      </notes>
      <segment>
        <source>Humanoid Gait with Reinforcement Learning</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="proj.gait.description">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">src/app/components/projects/projects.ts:47</note>
      </notes>
      <segment>
        <source>Reproducible PPO training and evaluation pipeline for the MuJoCo Humanoid-v5 environment, with a structured ablation study over observation components, reward shaping and control frequency.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="proj.iot.description">
      <notes>
        <note category="location">src/app/components/projects/projects.ts:56</note>
      </notes>
      <segment>
        <source>Staged progression from statistical anomaly detection (rolling z-score, IQR) to classical machine learning (Isolation Forest, Local Outlier Factor, One-Class SVM), working toward anomaly detection on real IoT network traffic from the VARIoT dataset.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
